{
  "extends": "../../tsconfig.base.json",
  "compilerOptions": {
    "noEmit": true,
    // Vitest resolves these files, not Node's ESM loader, so the extensionless
    // relative imports the suites already use (`../../vitest.workspace`) are what
    // actually runs. `NodeNext` from the base config rejects exactly those, which
    // would make the honest choice "leave the file unchecked" — the state this
    // config exists to end. `module: ESNext` is required for the bundler mode.
    "module": "ESNext",
    "moduleResolution": "Bundler",
    "types": ["node"],
    "allowImportingTsExtensions": true,
    "allowJs": true,
    "checkJs": false
  },
  "$comment": [
    "Type check for the test tree. `include` is an ENUMERATION and not `tests/**/*.ts`,",
    "and the reason is measured rather than stylistic: a whole-tree glob reports 208",
    "pre-existing errors in suites this change never touched, so adopting one here would",
    "either fail `pnpm check-types` on day one or force 208 unrelated edits into this",
    "change. The enumeration is therefore the boundary between what this change owns and",
    "what it does not.",
    "",
    "What it MUST hold is every TypeScript test file this change added — the earlier list",
    "carried five of forty, so a type error in the CI guards themselves (workflowHygiene,",
    "ownWorkflowTopology, shippedWorkflowShapeGate and the rest) left `check-types` green",
    "while vitest transpiled past it without checking. Adding a test file to this tree",
    "means adding it here."
  ],
  "include": [
    "vitest.config.ts",
    "vitest.knobs.ts",
    "vitest.workspace.ts",
    "tests/assets/actionPinBumpOwner.test.ts",
    "tests/assets/bareAnchorCitations.test.ts",
    "tests/assets/coverageDepthMatrix.test.ts",
    "tests/assets/coverageDepthMatrixHome.test.ts",
    "tests/assets/layerCiLaneMapping.test.ts",
    "tests/assets/retractedClaims.test.ts",
    "tests/assets/stageEvidenceCounts.test.ts",
    "tests/e2e/spec0003ShippedWorkflowSetE2E.test.ts",
    "tests/e2e/spec0006WorkflowsIntegrityE2E.test.ts",
    "tests/e2e/spec0008CredentialReuseGuidanceE2E.test.ts",
    "tests/e2e/spec0015HygieneLaneToReviewerGateE2E.test.ts",
    "tests/e2e/spec0017LayeredCiScaffoldE2E.test.ts",
    "tests/e2e/spec0017RunnerParallelismE2E.test.ts",
    "tests/helpers/buildCommand.ts",
    "tests/helpers/measurementClaim.ts",
    "tests/helpers/prototypingGateSurface.ts",
    "tests/helpers/recordProse.ts",
    "tests/helpers/shippedLaneCommands.ts",
    "tests/helpers/shippedWorkflowFixtures.ts",
    "tests/helpers/tempTree.ts",
    "tests/helpers/workflowsIntegrityFixtures.ts",
    "tests/integration/atddCredentialReuseGuidance.test.ts",
    "tests/integration/cli/commands/validate.tddProfileTableArity.test.ts",
    "tests/integration/cliStartupCost.test.ts",
    "tests/integration/scripts/checkAtddAnnotationLedger.test.ts",
    "tests/integration/scripts/checkPublishDryRun.test.ts",
    "tests/integration/shippedWorkflowDetection.test.ts",
    "tests/integration/shippedWorkflowInertness.test.ts",
    "tests/integration/shippedWorkflowOwnership.test.ts",
    "tests/integration/shippedWorkflowPins.test.ts",
    "tests/integration/shippedWorkflowPortability.test.ts",
    "tests/integration/shippedWorkflowRunners.test.ts",
    "tests/integration/shippedWorkflowShape.ts",
    "tests/integration/shippedWorkflowShapeGate.test.ts",
    "tests/integration/shippedWorkflowTopology.test.ts",
    "tests/integration/shippedWorkflows.test.ts",
    "tests/integration/spec0006DoctorFailOnError.test.ts",
    "tests/integration/spec0006WorkflowsIntegrity.advisoryBucket.test.ts",
    "tests/integration/spec0006WorkflowsIntegrity.declined.test.ts",
    "tests/integration/spec0006WorkflowsIntegrity.drift.test.ts",
